WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.033 --> 00:00:01.501
360 exclusive with the former

00:00:01.501 --> 00:00:02.736
fighter for the volunteer group

00:00:02.736 --> 00:00:03.837
who has defected.

00:00:03.837 --> 00:00:04.437
As you know,

00:00:04.437 --> 00:00:05.638
volunteer group is a mercenary

00:00:05.638 --> 00:00:06.139
force run

00:00:06.139 --> 00:00:08.041
by Yevgeny Prigozhin, a Russian oligarch

00:00:08.041 --> 00:00:09.609
close to Vladimir Putin.

00:00:09.609 --> 00:00:11.011
The US has labeled Wagner

00:00:11.011 --> 00:00:12.912
a transnational criminal organization

00:00:12.912 --> 00:00:13.613
which has been heavily

00:00:13.613 --> 00:00:14.280
involved in the war

00:00:14.280 --> 00:00:15.615
in Ukraine, has been heavily

00:00:15.615 --> 00:00:17.717
recruiting from Russian prisons.

00:00:17.717 --> 00:00:19.519
Bloggers taking credit for recent gains

00:00:19.519 --> 00:00:20.920
in the areas around Bermuda.

00:00:20.920 --> 00:00:22.088
There's been a lot of reports

00:00:22.088 --> 00:00:23.323
of fatalities

00:00:23.323 --> 00:00:24.057
among volunteers,

00:00:24.057 --> 00:00:24.791
poorly trained

00:00:24.791 --> 00:00:25.191
and equipped

00:00:25.191 --> 00:00:26.459
convicts, and reports

00:00:26.459 --> 00:00:28.361
that those who refuse to fight

00:00:28.361 --> 00:00:29.295
or attempt to escape

00:00:29.295 --> 00:00:31.531
are executed as a warning to others.

00:00:31.531 --> 00:00:32.098
One volunteer

00:00:32.098 --> 00:00:34.200
fighter who defected to Ukrainian forces

00:00:34.234 --> 00:00:36.269
and then was sent back to Russia

00:00:36.269 --> 00:00:37.137
as part of a prisoner

00:00:37.137 --> 00:00:38.071
exchange

00:00:38.071 --> 00:00:39.606
was then executed on camera

00:00:39.606 --> 00:00:41.107
with the sledgehammer.

00:00:41.107 --> 00:00:42.308
Now, a man named Andrei

00:00:42.308 --> 00:00:43.610
Medvedev, claiming

00:00:43.610 --> 00:00:45.178
to have defected from the Wagner

00:00:45.178 --> 00:00:47.180
group, has crossed into Norway

00:00:47.180 --> 00:00:48.248
and has just been released

00:00:48.248 --> 00:00:49.015
after being interviewed

00:00:49.015 --> 00:00:50.283
by Norwegian officials.

00:00:50.283 --> 00:00:52.652
He's hoping to receive asylum there.

00:00:52.652 --> 00:00:53.820
Andre, an orphan,

00:00:53.820 --> 00:00:55.188
spent four years in prison

00:00:55.188 --> 00:00:56.322
in Russia for robbery

00:00:56.322 --> 00:00:57.824
before joining the Wagner group.

00:00:57.824 --> 00:00:58.491
And we should note

00:00:58.491 --> 00:00:59.492
his service in Bognor

00:00:59.492 --> 00:01:01.761
was confirmed by its leader, Prigozhin.

00:01:01.761 --> 00:01:04.431
I spoke to Andrei Medvedev before airtime

00:01:07.200 --> 00:01:08.701
If you could just talk a little bit

00:01:08.701 --> 00:01:10.236
about what it was like

00:01:10.236 --> 00:01:10.737
in the

00:01:10.737 --> 00:01:13.473
in in the battle on the battlefield

00:01:13.640 --> 00:01:15.909
with the prisoners.

00:01:15.909 --> 00:01:18.344
How were they how were they used?

00:01:18.378 --> 00:01:19.813
What were the tactics?

00:01:19.813 --> 00:01:22.282
What was it like?

00:01:22.282 --> 00:01:24.818
[speaking Russian]

00:01:24.818 --> 00:01:28.221
We weren't receiving any tactical plans.

00:01:28.288 --> 00:01:29.289
We just got a command

00:01:29.289 --> 00:01:30.824
to capture the position of the enemy.

00:01:30.824 --> 00:01:32.225
And by ourselves

00:01:32.225 --> 00:01:33.326
had to come up with a step

00:01:33.326 --> 00:01:35.462
by step plan of how to fulfill it.

00:01:35.462 --> 00:01:36.596
It was our problem

00:01:36.596 --> 00:01:39.933
to ensure that a command is fulfilled.

00:01:39.933 --> 00:01:42.102
You have said in the past that you saw

00:01:43.870 --> 00:01:46.940
Wagner troops getting executed

00:01:46.940 --> 00:01:48.241
for disobeying orders.

00:01:48.241 --> 00:01:49.409
Is that accurate?

00:01:49.409 --> 00:01:52.579
[speaking Russian] such cases happened

00:01:52.579 --> 00:01:53.680
very often there.

00:01:53.680 --> 00:01:54.481
There was a question

00:01:54.481 --> 00:01:56.015
of how to persuade new recruits

00:01:56.015 --> 00:01:57.684
who arrived at the front lines

00:01:57.684 --> 00:01:58.151
and saw

00:01:58.151 --> 00:01:59.652
what is going on there and decided

00:01:59.652 --> 00:02:00.887
they don't want a fight

00:02:00.887 --> 00:02:02.989
to still go ahead and fight.

00:02:02.989 --> 00:02:03.990
They would round up those

00:02:03.990 --> 00:02:05.024
who did not want to fight

00:02:05.024 --> 00:02:06.693
and shoot them in front of the newcomers

00:02:06.693 --> 00:02:07.327
to develop their

00:02:07.327 --> 00:02:08.795
self-preservation instinct.

00:02:09.863 --> 00:02:11.564
Why did you decide to leave

00:02:11.564 --> 00:02:12.966
the Wagner Group?

00:02:12.966 --> 00:02:15.835
-- I plan to leave Wagner for a while,

00:02:15.835 --> 00:02:17.670
but I didn't have the opportunity.

00:02:17.670 --> 00:02:19.172
I was afraid I will be captured

00:02:19.172 --> 00:02:20.640
and shot as a traitor.

00:02:20.640 --> 00:02:22.342
I am ready for serious action,

00:02:22.342 --> 00:02:24.644
but I also want to live by the end.

00:02:24.644 --> 00:02:26.212
I knew they won't let me go.

00:02:26.212 --> 00:02:27.013
I will return

00:02:27.013 --> 00:02:29.249
as part of the dead or the wounded.

00:02:29.249 --> 00:02:31.351
It was time to make a radical decision.

00:02:31.351 --> 00:02:32.719
If it wasn't for my guys,

00:02:32.719 --> 00:02:33.620
my comrades,

00:02:33.620 --> 00:02:34.587
I would have been buried

00:02:34.587 --> 00:02:36.923
at some training ground.

00:02:36.923 --> 00:02:40.326
There have been allegations and reports

00:02:40.326 --> 00:02:43.596
of the execution of civilians,

00:02:43.596 --> 00:02:45.732
people, civilians, being shot

00:02:45.732 --> 00:02:47.901
just walking down the street

00:02:47.901 --> 00:02:50.270
of abuse of civilians.

00:02:50.837 --> 00:02:52.539
Did you see any of that?

00:02:52.539 --> 00:02:54.941
Did you witness any of that?

00:02:54.941 --> 00:02:59.145
-- I cannot say I witnessed this

00:02:59.145 --> 00:03:00.180
because I was tasked

00:03:00.180 --> 00:03:01.648
mainly with forested areas

00:03:01.648 --> 00:03:03.383
and approaches to parliament.

00:03:03.383 --> 00:03:05.552
I am not aware of such cases

00:03:05.552 --> 00:03:06.186
no matter what.

00:03:06.186 --> 00:03:07.820
We had a strict code of conduct

00:03:07.820 --> 00:03:08.521
for fighters.

00:03:08.521 --> 00:03:10.023
If those rules are breached,

00:03:10.023 --> 00:03:11.191
there will be punishment.

00:03:12.492 --> 00:03:15.061
You escaped into into Norway

00:03:15.662 --> 00:03:17.864
and the spot where you crossed over

00:03:19.399 --> 00:03:19.933
where you said

00:03:19.933 --> 00:03:21.334
that you crossed over into Norway.

00:03:21.334 --> 00:03:22.302
It's very heavily

00:03:22.302 --> 00:03:24.837
guarded on the Russian border.

00:03:24.837 --> 00:03:27.106
And some people have raised questions

00:03:27.106 --> 00:03:28.841
about how you were able

00:03:28.841 --> 00:03:30.243
to even get to the border

00:03:30.243 --> 00:03:31.711
because it's so heavily.

00:03:31.711 --> 00:03:32.879
There are so many checkpoints

00:03:32.879 --> 00:03:36.482
on the way there Why cross at that place

00:03:36.482 --> 00:03:39.552
where it was so heavily guarded?

00:03:39.552 --> 00:03:42.488
--- I will say that the border

00:03:42.488 --> 00:03:43.223
with Norway,

00:03:43.223 --> 00:03:44.090
where I crossed

00:03:44.090 --> 00:03:45.458
is not as protected

00:03:45.458 --> 00:03:47.460
as much as the border with Finland.

00:03:47.460 --> 00:03:48.228
But in this case,

00:03:48.228 --> 00:03:49.629
I am honestly very grateful

00:03:49.629 --> 00:03:50.196
for the training

00:03:50.196 --> 00:03:51.364
I received with the Ministry

00:03:51.364 --> 00:03:52.232
of Russian Defense,

00:03:52.232 --> 00:03:53.866
where I did military service

00:03:53.866 --> 00:03:55.568
and grateful to Wagner.

00:03:55.568 --> 00:03:56.102
The training

00:03:56.102 --> 00:03:57.604
I received there came in useful

00:03:57.604 --> 00:03:59.973
and I gladly put it to use.

00:03:59.973 --> 00:04:02.408
Did you have help getting across

00:04:02.408 --> 00:04:04.310
because aren't there many checkpoints

00:04:04.310 --> 00:04:05.845
even to get close to the border?

00:04:07.380 --> 00:04:07.614
No.

00:04:07.614 --> 00:04:08.248
Yeah.

00:04:08.648 --> 00:04:09.449
I was helped

00:04:09.449 --> 00:04:10.416
by workers of human

00:04:10.416 --> 00:04:12.485
rights groups in Moscow and elsewhere,

00:04:12.819 --> 00:04:14.854
even just civilians who heard my story.

00:04:15.154 --> 00:04:17.023
When I was approaching the last post

00:04:17.023 --> 00:04:18.124
next to the border.

00:04:18.124 --> 00:04:19.959
I was helped by a man from Murmansk

00:04:19.959 --> 00:04:21.361
who found a passport of a man

00:04:21.361 --> 00:04:23.029
who looked similar to me.

00:04:23.029 --> 00:04:24.397
I am very grateful to him

00:04:24.397 --> 00:04:26.099
but cannot disclose his identity

00:04:26.099 --> 00:04:27.300
for his safety.

00:04:27.300 --> 00:04:28.935
The passport helps me to get past

00:04:28.935 --> 00:04:29.869
the control post,

00:04:29.869 --> 00:04:30.536
and I was able

00:04:30.536 --> 00:04:32.572
to get closer to the border.

00:04:32.572 --> 00:04:35.541
Why have you agreed to to talk?

00:04:35.575 --> 00:04:38.311
Why do you. What message are you trying?

00:04:38.544 --> 00:04:40.113
Do you want people to know

00:04:40.113 --> 00:04:43.783
about Wagner, about your experience?

00:04:43.783 --> 00:04:48.187
---- My idea was to tell the people

00:04:48.187 --> 00:04:49.455
what was happening there.

00:04:49.455 --> 00:04:51.391
And my mates who died there,

00:04:51.391 --> 00:04:53.393
they died under orders.

00:04:53.393 --> 00:04:54.294
So my aim

00:04:54.294 --> 00:04:54.927
is that the people

00:04:54.927 --> 00:04:56.396
who are guilty of these crimes

00:04:56.396 --> 00:04:58.331
should be brought to justice.

00:04:58.331 --> 00:04:59.632
And when you say the people

00:04:59.632 --> 00:05:01.200
who are guilty, who do you mean?

00:05:01.200 --> 00:05:02.535
And what are they guilty of?

00:05:04.070 --> 00:05:04.504
Yeah.

00:05:04.504 --> 00:05:05.038
You know,

00:05:05.038 --> 00:05:06.739
I would like to take this opportunity

00:05:06.739 --> 00:05:08.074
of stating publicly.

00:05:08.074 --> 00:05:08.941
Maybe other folk

00:05:08.941 --> 00:05:10.143
have different views about this,

00:05:10.143 --> 00:05:12.312
but the first culprit is Prigozhin

00:05:12.312 --> 00:05:14.247
because he is the top leader.

00:05:14.247 --> 00:05:15.915
Prigozhin runs the Wagner Group.

00:05:15.915 --> 00:05:17.350
He's in charge of it.

00:05:17.483 --> 00:05:19.652
---- Yes, him.

00:05:19.652 --> 00:05:20.553
Absolutely.

00:05:20.553 --> 00:05:22.622
And the whole coordinating Wagner lot.

00:05:22.889 --> 00:05:24.390
And everyone knows it's subject

00:05:24.390 --> 00:05:25.958
to the Russian government's commands.

00:05:25.958 --> 00:05:27.327
The whole lot of them.

00:05:27.327 --> 00:05:29.362
Does that include Vladimir Putin?

00:05:29.362 --> 00:05:31.898
No success in Syria?

00:05:31.898 --> 00:05:33.299
Well, everyone knows that

00:05:33.299 --> 00:05:34.100
what is happening

00:05:34.100 --> 00:05:37.103
there is his decision, of course.

00:05:37.103 --> 00:05:38.304
And just finally, Andre,

00:05:38.304 --> 00:05:39.906
you lost a lot of,

00:05:39.906 --> 00:05:42.742
as you say, mates in the fighting.

00:05:44.277 --> 00:05:44.644
What?

00:05:44.644 --> 00:05:46.112
What should their mothers know?

00:05:46.112 --> 00:05:47.480
What should their families know

00:05:47.480 --> 00:05:50.049
about what happened to them?

00:05:50.049 --> 00:05:52.652
--- They were great people.

00:05:52.985 --> 00:05:54.153
Great because they were real

00:05:54.153 --> 00:05:54.954
human beings.

00:05:54.954 --> 00:05:56.055
And I can assure you

00:05:56.055 --> 00:05:57.523
that many were sober judges

00:05:57.523 --> 00:05:59.492
of what was happening out there.

00:05:59.492 --> 00:06:01.561
They were just people, normal folk.

00:06:01.561 --> 00:06:02.228
And that applied

00:06:02.228 --> 00:06:03.329
to the other side as well,

00:06:03.329 --> 00:06:04.397
because I had occasion

00:06:04.397 --> 00:06:05.598
to see the bravery of the

00:06:05.598 --> 00:06:07.033
Ukrainian forces, too.

00:06:08.668 --> 00:06:09.902
Andrei, I appreciate your time.

00:06:09.902 --> 00:06:10.737
Thank you.

00:06:12.505 --> 00:06:13.973
--- Thank you.

